        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685597" data-guid="7685597"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685597" data-guid="7685597" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685597_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The authority herein granted shall include the provisions contained in § 1640, Subdivision (a), and §§ <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/1640-a" target="_blank">1640-a</a>, <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/1641" target="_blank">1641</a>, <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/1643" target="_blank">1643</a> and <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/1644" target="_blank">1644</a>, of the Vehicle and Traffic Law of the State of New York.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
