<div class="section_content content" id="7685599_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The definitions of terms as set forth in Title 1, §§ <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/100" target="_blank">100</a> through <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/159" target="_blank">159</a>, of the Vehicle and Traffic Law of the State of New York, dated September 1977, are hereby made applicable to this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
